  "details": "The badge of age verification status can no longer be hidden because it's part of the Trust Shield icon as of VRChat 2025.1.2.\n\nIn other words, but the \"Age Verification\" Help & Info still subtly refers to the ability to choose between three states: \"Hidden\", \"Verified\" and \"Verified 18+\". The current state of VRChat only allows to choose between \"Hidden\" and \"Verified 18+\".\n\n1. Open Main Menu.\n\n2. Click the \"?\" icon top right for Help & Info.\n\n3. Navigate to Safety group on the left.\n\n4. Click \"Age Verification\". Read the first paragraph below the video carefully.\n\n5. If your account's status is Verified 18+, navigate to your profile and notice the option referred in the text to display the former blue \"verified\" badge without 18+ status is no longer an option.\n\nAdditional info: [VRChat 2025.1.2 § Age Verification Updates](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202512#age-verification-updates).",
